    <item>
      <title>Fanesis (Facial Network Analysis)</title>
      <link>https://sulthanabiyyu.github.io/project/fanesis/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 29 Oct 2023 16:30:54 +0700</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://sulthanabiyyu.github.io/project/fanesis/</guid>
      <description>Introduction Fanesis is a Facial Network Analysis tool that analyzes the faces and behaviors of individuals in a group and creates a visual representation of their relationships. Fanesis uses computer vision and machine learning techniques to detect the emotions and interactions of each individual. It then creates two types of associations: group-based and emotion-based. Group-based associations show how individuals are connected within the group, such as who knows whom, who is close to whom, and who is influential to whom.</description>
    </item>
    
